<title>AUSTRALIA: Healthscope CEO Kricker resigns.</title>
<headline>Healthscope CEO Kricker resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hospital operator Healthscope Ltd said on Monday its chief executive Bill Kricker had resigned.</p>
<p>Healthscope did not give the reasons for the resignations or say who would replace Kricker.</p>
<p>A spokesman for Healthscope was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>Healthscope also announced various board changes, including the appointment of Richard England as Deputy Chairman and the appointment of Ian Stoney as Chief Operating Officer and as an additional Company Secretary.  </p>
<p>Healthscope's shares were untraded at 10.25 a.m. (0025 GMT), having closed unchanged at 62 cents on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
